    "Clones and inactive clone bodies are artificial beings, not items.",
    "Services, facilities, actions, effects, conditions, checks, and failure tables are not item types.",
    "A modification is an item only when independently acquired, installed, removed, transferred, or tracked.",
    "Inventory-tracked materials are items; crafting procedures and material-effect rules are supporting rules.",
